0..69 Comment "// The shape of a category, after the HoTT book\'s Definition 9.1.1 (a"
70..142 Comment "// precategory): objects, a hom-type between two of them, identities and"
143..218 Comment "// composition with the unit and associativity laws as rules. Its coherence"
219..253 Comment "// cells are in `coherence.gandr`."
255..329 Comment "/// The category shape. Its laws over the dependent sort are read with the"
330..406 Comment "/// objects each composite stands at, so the unit laws agree at `comp(id(a),"
407..427 Comment "/// id(a))` (#1510)."
